t.ts`](file:///C:/avg/w5/r/test/app.test.ts#L21-L54) and [`test/adapters.test.ts`](file:///C:/avg/w5/r/test/adapters.test.ts#L48-L54), updated assertions to verify both new and deprecated fields on published `OrderPlaced` events.\n\nAll tests, dependency checks (`npm run arch`), and type checks (`npm run typecheck`) pass.\n",
